0,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1597,"retries":0},{"seq":704,"t":4500,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"Doctrine: Strike first, send horse to West Ford to raid Orchid camp. Cav-1 is at Orchid Camp, but I need to reinforce the strike on F1. I'll use the Cav to attack the nearest enemy position, which is Orchid Inf at S-West (2w ago). I need speed, so plain orders."},{"seq":705,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c265","house":"rhino","letter":"L317","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1","s-west","orchid-camp"],"depart":4500,"plain":"HORSE, ATTACK AT SOUTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":706,"t":4500,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1665,"retries":0},{"seq":707,"t":4500,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"The doctrine demands holding the East Ford with elephants/inf and archers on the north bank. I must re-send orders twice. My units are somewhat scattered. I will reinforce F3 (East Ford) and position archers on N-East."},{"seq":708,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c266","house":"kite","letter":"L318","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":4800,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, ITQLD SK NTRS BKQO."},{"seq":709,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c267","house":"kite","letter":"L319","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":4800,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO NORTH BANK EAST.","cipher":"AKWINJ, ITQLD SK JKQSD ATJG NTRS."},{"seq":710,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c268","house":"kite","letter":"L319","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","n-ferry","n-east"],"depart":4800,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO NORTH BANK EAST.","cipher":"AKWINJ, ITQLD SK JKQSD ATJG NTRS."},{"seq":711,"t":4500,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1655,"retries":0},{"seq":712,"t":4500,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino and Tiger are at peace. My doctrine suggests making peace early. I will send a cipher letter to both to attempt a truce, and then consolidate forces to take the middle ford (F2) while they are distracted or negotiating."},{"seq":713,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c269","house":"orchid","letter":"L320","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid","F2"],"depart":4800,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"RMOKJS AKKT, DKHS BT IESSHM AKQS."},{"seq":714,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c270","house":"orchid","letter":"L321","kind":"letter","to":"tiger-camp","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","tiger-camp"],"depart":4800,"plain":"TRUCE","cipher":"TQUOM"},{"seq":715,"t":4500,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1741,"retries":0},{"seq":716,"t":4500,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"Orchid offered a truce, which is in effect. My doctrine is to mass on the east ford late. I will use the truce to consolidate and prepare for the end game, while adhering to the decoy strategy."},{"seq":717,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c271","house":"tiger","letter":"L322","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","s-east"],"depart":4800,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT SOUTH BANK EAST.","cipher":"ECNOQ EKKQ, BKGI SQ OKUQB TSJF PSOQ."},{"seq":718,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c272","house":"tiger","letter":"L323","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-2","path":["tiger-camp","s-east"],"depart":4800,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":"OPRKJI EKKQ, BKGI SQ PSOQ EKNI."},{"seq":719,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c273","house":"tiger","letter":"L324","kind":"order","to":"tiger-arch-1","path":["tiger-camp","s-east"],"depart":4800,"plain":"BOWMEN, WATCH THE ROADS AT SOUTH BANK EAST.","cipher":"TKWHPJ, WSQRB QBP NKSIO SQ OKUQB TSJF PSOQ."},{"seq":720,"t":4500,"type":"delivered","courier":"c245","letter":"L290","house":"kite"},{"seq":721,"t":4500,"type":"delivered","courier":"c251","letter":"L296","house":"tiger"},{"seq":722,"t":